
* DYNAMO MODEL: SYSTEM DYNAMICS SIMULATION FOR RESOURCE FLOW ANALYSIS
* LANGUAGE: DYNAMO
* OBJECTIVE: Implement a robust system dynamics simulation model for resource flow analysis

* ========================================
* MODEL DEFINITION & INITIALIZATION
* ========================================

MODEL SIMULATION OF ECOSYSTEM RESOURCE DYNAMICS

* ========================================
* LEVEL VARIABLES (STOCKS)
* ========================================

LEVEL RES_LEVEL(T) = RES_LEVEL(N) + DT * (GROWTH_RATE(N) - HARVEST_RATE(N) - DECAY_RATE(N))

* Natural resource stock at current time step
* Initial conditions
LEVEL RES_LEVEL = 1000

* ========================================
* RATE VARIABLES (FLOWS)
* ========================================

RATE GROWTH_RATE
RATE HARVEST_RATE
RATE DECAY_RATE

GROWTH_RATE(T) = ALPHA * RES_LEVEL(N) * (1 - RES_LEVEL(N) / CARRYING_CAPACITY)
HARVEST_RATE(T) = EFFORT_FACTOR * RES_LEVEL(N)
DECAY_RATE(T) = DECAY_COEFF * RES_LEVEL(N)

* Growth follows logistic model with carrying capacity
* Harvest rate depends on effort factor
* Decay rate depends on environmental decay coefficient

* ========================================
* AUXILIARY VARIABLES & PARAMETERS
* ========================================

AUX ALPHA
AUX CARRYING_CAPACITY
AUX EFFORT_FACTOR
AUX DECAY_COEFF
AUX DT

ALPHA = 0.1
CARRYING_CAPACITY = 5000
EFFORT_FACTOR = 0.05
DECAY_COEFF = 0.02
DT = 1.0

* ========================================
* SIMULATION CONTROL & OUTPUT
* ========================================

SIMULATION STARTS AT T = 0
SIMULATION ENDS AT T = 100
OUTPUT INTERVAL = DT

PRNT T, RES_LEVEL, GROWTH_RATE, HARVEST_RATE, DECAY_RATE

* ========================================
* FEEDBACK LOOPS & INTERACTIONS
* ========================================

* Positive feedback: Resource growth supports more resource
* Negative feedback: Resource depletion limits growth
* External feedback: Environmental decay reduces resource

END OF MODEL
